t and very early miscarriage, causing\nseeming sterility."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"urinary","label":"Urinary","startLine":35463,"endLine":35466,"text":"hrequent urging. Cu[)ious, pale, light-\ncolored urine. Cannot hold water on coughing or\nwalking."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"rectum","label":"Rectum","startLine":35467,"endLine":35469,"text":"^ — Stools large and hard, with cutting in\nrectum and soreness of anus."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"extremities","label":"Extremities","startLine":35470,"endLine":35472,"text":"Stiff, sore feeling in nape of neck.\nSacral backache. Ia)wer extremities weak and heavy."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"modalities","label":"Modalities","startLine":35473,"endLine":35476,"text":"Worse, lying on affected side, in warm\nroom, evening and night. Better, in open air and\nresting."},{"source":"04_boericke_materia_medica","section":"relationship","label":"Relationship","startLine":35477,"endLine":35481,"text":"Compare Virburnum prunifolium\n(habitual miscarriage; after-pains; cancer of the\ntongue; obstinate hiccough; supposed to be a uterine\ntonic). Cimicif.; Cauloph,; Sep.; Xanthox."}],"corpusPassages":[]}